@@ -9,6 +9,7 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication for staff accounts: login (with remember me and per e-mail + IP lockout), registration, logout, forgot/reset password, and e-mail verification. Built as Livewire full-page components and Blade pages with Bulma; the UI is pt-BR by default with English fallback (`lang/pt_BR/ui.php`, `lang/en/ui.php`). One app-wide password rule (min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers) in `AppServiceProvider`.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
